  <h1>Personal Loans</h1>
  <section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>Discover the Perfect Personal Loans for Your Lifestyle</h2>
    <p>At RupeeXpert, we strive to make it simple and straightforward for you to find the ideal personal loan that meets your unique financial needs. Whether you’re facing an unexpected expense, planning a major purchase, or looking to consolidate debt, we offer a range of options to help you manage your finances effectively.</p>
</section>
  <section id="selection" class="container">
    <h2>Why Choose a Personal Loan through RupeeXpert?</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Variety of Options:</strong>We partner with leading banks and financial institutions to provide you with a wide selection of personal loan options. This ensures that you can find a loan that perfectly matches your financial situation and goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Competitive Rates:</strong> Our personal loans come with attractive interest rates that help you save money over the life of the loan. We work to find you the best rates available, so you can borrow affordably.</li>
        <li><strong>Simple Application:</strong>We’ve designed a quick and easy application process that you can complete online. With just a few steps, you can apply for your loan from the comfort of your home.</li>
        <li><strong>Flexible Terms:</strong> Choose from a variety of loan terms that fit your needs. Whether you need a short-term loan to cover immediate expenses or a longer-term loan for larger financial goals, we have options to suit you.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast Approval:</strong>Our streamlined approval process means you won’t have to wait long to get the funds you need. We aim to provide quick approvals so you can access your money without unnecessary delays.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="benefits" class="container">
    <h2>Benefits of Our Personal Loans</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Quick Access to Funds:</strong>Get the money you need quickly and efficiently. Whether you’re dealing with an emergency, making a big purchase, or managing other expenses, our personal loans provide timely financial support.</li>
        <li><strong>Affordable Payments:</strong>With competitive rates and flexible repayment terms, managing your loan payments is easier and more affordable. We aim to offer solutions that fit comfortably within your budget.</li>
        <li><strong>No Hidden Fees:</strong>We pride ourselves on transparency. Our personal loans come with clear terms and no hidden fees, so you know exactly what you’re getting into.</li>
        <li><strong>Personalized Service:</strong>Our dedicated team is here to assist you every step of the way. From finding the best loan options to answering any questions you may have, we provide personalized support to help you make informed decisions.</li>
    </ul>
</section>



<section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Explore Options:</strong>Start by browsing through our diverse range of personal loan offers. Compare the features, benefits, and terms to find the loan that best suits your needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Check Eligibility:</strong>Use our easy-to-use online tool to check if you qualify for a loan. This will help you identify the best options and rates available to you.</li>
        <li><strong>Apply Online:</strong>Complete a secure online application form with your personal and financial details. Our platform makes the application process simple and straightforward.</li>
        <li><strong>Get Approved:</strong>Once your application is reviewed and approved, the funds will be deposited directly into your account. You can start using your loan as soon as you receive it.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
    <div class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What documents do I need to apply for a personal loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Typically, you will need proof of identity (such as a passport or driver’s license), proof of address (such as a utility bill), and proof of income (such as a salary slip or bank statement). These documents help us verify your identity and financial situation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How long does it take to get approved for a personal loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">The approval time can vary depending on the bank and your application details. Generally, it takes a few days to a week to receive approval. We strive to provide quick responses so you can get the funds you need as soon as possible.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">Can I apply for more than one personal loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes, you can apply for multiple personal loans if needed. However, it’s important to manage multiple loans responsibly to avoid overextending your finances and accumulating debt.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How do I check the status of my personal loan application?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">You can check the status of your loan application by logging into your RupeeXpert account or contacting the bank directly. We provide regular updates on the progress of your application.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What should I do if my personal loan application is denied?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">If your loan application is denied, review the reasons provided by the bank. You may need to improve your credit score or provide additional documentation. Consider applying for a different loan that better matches your financial profile.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(question => {
      question.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const answer = question.nextElementSibling;
          question.classList.toggle('active');
          answer.classList.toggle('show');
      });
  });
